# URL migration audit output (regenerated by scripts/audit-url-migration.mjs).
# The committed baseline lives at docs/url-migration-audit.md; the raw JSON and
# the default `--out` location in the repo root are generated artifacts.
docs/url-migration-audit.json
/url-audit.json
/url-audit.md

# WordPress source exports (WXR) and Redirection plugin dumps. These are large
# re-downloadable inputs to the migration audit, not source. The WXR files run
# to tens of MB and the browser appends " (1)" on re-download, so match loosely.
*.WordPress.*.xml
redirection-export*.json
